Alias      K_S0sig K_S0
ChargeConj K_S0sig K_S0sig

Define CKM_angle 0.0

Decay Upsilon(4S)
1.000 B0 anti-B0 B0sig anti-B0sig VSS_BMIX dm;
Enddecay

Decay B0sig
1.000 pi+ pi- K_S0sig             PHSP;
Enddecay

CDecay anti-B0sig

Decay K_S0sig
1.000 pi+ pi-                     PHSP;
Enddecay

End
